# Context is the repo root for every app's Dockerfile.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env*
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
**/README.md
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# Infrastructure never goes into an app image. Ignoring it also keeps local
# Terraform state and the provider cache out of the build context.
apps/infra
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
